{"id": "68342", "title": "繁星", "author": "呼吸阳光", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 35, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68342.htm", "intro": "当一只笨头笨脑翅膀还没长硬的土麻雀掉进金光灿灿的狼窝时。\r\n要学会以下几点：\r\n第一，要保护好翅膀，免得被拔毛。\r\n第二，被拔毛的时候“不要”叫，免得被拔光。\r\n第三，被拔光了也不要反抗，免得被煮了吃。\r\n……最后……狼被吃了……\r\n\r\n一句话简介：一个闷不吭声，隐忍胆小的小奴隶逆袭高富帅、雅痞少爷的故事。", "base": "files/article/html/68/68342", "chapters": [{"title": "当时年少", "file": "10525570.html", "available": false}, {"title": "初来乍到", "file": "10525571.html", "available": false}, {"title": "傻傻不清", "file": "10525572.html", "available": false}, {"title": "最初的恋", "file": "10525573.html", "available": false}, {"title": "被表白了", "file": "10525574.html", "available": false}, {"title": "与你相融", "file": "10525575.html", "available": false}, {"title": "日渐丰满", "file": "10525576.html", "available": false}, {"title": "情不自禁", "file": "10525577.html", "available": false}, {"title": "追到家了", "file": "10525578.html", "available": false}, {"title": "滋生情愫", "file": "10525579.html", "available": false}, {"title": "他的事情", "file": "10525580.html", "available": false}, {"title": "情书主人", "file": "10525581.html", "available": false}, {"title": "亲吻亲吻", "file": "10525582.html", "available": false}, {"title": "曲终人散", "file": "10525583.html", "available": false}, {"title": "重逢之前", "file": "10525584.html", "available": false}, {"title": "念念不忘", "file": "10525585.html", "available": false}, {"title": "那份悸动", "file": "10525586.html", "available": false}, {"title": "请你吃饭", "file": "10525587.html", "available": false}, {"title": "如愿一场", "file": "10525588.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正在进行", "file": "10525589.html", "available": false}, {"title": "撞见恋情", "file": "10525590.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我很认真", "file": "10525591.html", "available": false}, {"title": "美女归来", "file": "10525592.html", "available": false}, {"title": "那么辛苦", "file": "10525593.html", "available": false}, {"title": "25-29", "file": "10525594.html", "available": f